\par\par \b \uc2 News Highlights: Top Global Markets News of the Day\b0\par\par\uc2 431 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Mai 2017\par 11:00\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2017, Dow Jones & Company, Inc. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Global Shares Gain After Fed Minutes \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Global stocks moved higher as investors parsed the latest minutes from the \f28 \uc2 \f2 Federal Reserve\f28 \uc2 \f2  and major oil producers gathered for a closely watched meeting in Vienna. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par BIS Releases New Set of Standards for \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Trading \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 A group of global standards-setters on Thursday completed a new set of principles for trading in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign-exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market, capping a two-year effort to improve transparency after a series of collusion scandals at major banks. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Beijing's Take on the China-U.S. Trade Relationship: It's All Good \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 China's assessment of the trade relationship with the U.S.: The imbalance isn't that bad, job losses at U.S. steel mills aren't \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 China\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's fault and Beijing's yuan \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  benefit the U.S. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Fed Should Be Judged On How Well It Achieves Mandates, Fed's Evans Says \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Chicago Fed Chief \f28 \uc2 \f2 Charles Evans\f28 \uc2 \f2  said a conservative disposition among policy makers can make it hard to truly achieve a 'symmetric' inflation target, where price pressures above and below the target are equally unwelcome. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par U.S. Dollar Finds Unusual Favor in Hong Kong \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The U.S. dollar has been on something of a tear-against one \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  where it ought to be quite stable. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par BOJ to Continue Monetary Easing, Says Board Member Sakurai \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Bank of Japan\f28 \uc2 \f2  board member Makoto Sakurai said Thursday that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will carry on with its easing program by keeping interest rates low and expanding its monetary base, dismissing speculation of tightening soon. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par China Securities Regulator Punishes Three Domestic Brokerages \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 China's securities regulator punished three domestic brokerages for violating rules on margin trading with transactions on behalf of Chicago-based \f28 \uc2 \f2 Citadel LLC\f28 \uc2 \f2 . \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Bank of Korea Keeps Base Rate Unchanged at 1.25% \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The Bank of Korea\f28 \uc2 \f2  left interest rates unchanged for a 10th straight meeting, maintaining its support for the economy, though an improved growth outlook and U.S. policy tightening point toward an eventual rate increase. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Fed's Kaplan Maintains Need to Raise Rates \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Dallas Fed Chief \f28 \uc2 \f2 Robert Kaplan\f28 \uc2 \f2  said he believes there should be two more additional rate increases in 2017, and even then monetary policy would still be accommodative. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Fed Minutes Signal Officials Ready to Raise Rates Again Soon \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Federal Reserve\f28 \uc2 \f2  officials expected at their meeting this month that it would "soon be appropriate" to raise rates, according to minutes of the gathering, a signal the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  could lift its benchmark rate in June.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 May 25, 2017 05:00 ET (09:00 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020170525ed5p000q0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
